      Data: 21|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'KatamariBallMotor.startVolumeMm3, in mm^3. The analytic quantum needs
        this one number: D^3 is linear in (start + confirmed) and the sphere constant
        cancels. 0 = not baked, so the quantum reads 0 and the driver reports the
        metric as unavailable instead of guessing.'
